  {
    "id": 40004,
    "uuid": "05d64101-c050-4b7b-b4f1-3ca7a0fd691e",
    "hitokoto": "天有烘炉，地生五金，晖冶寒萃照云清。星藏点雪，月隐晦明，拙山枯水大江行。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "画中人",
    "creator": "白月魁",
    "creator_uid": 9610,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1628209519",
    "length": 36
  },
  {
    "id": 40005,
    "uuid": "c0213ba7-6569-47b4-81d1-c1fc1a571784",
    "hitokoto": "狂风吹打山岩，自己却先粉身碎骨。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "翎羽",
    "creator": "xystarworld",
    "creator_uid": 10921,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1638100534",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 40006,
    "uuid": "eb5c8d76-3be4-4037-af3e-49da5c79159d",
    "hitokoto": "见过沧海桑田，望过白日飞升，走过拙山枯水，笑过月隐晦明。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "未知",
    "creator": "xystarworld",
    "creator_uid": 10921,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1638100717",
    "length": 28
  },
  {
    "id": 40007,
    "uuid": "0dfe9a8a-7825-4a2e-b71a-94a584d2a6d1",
    "hitokoto": "泪锋之剑，当弃即弃。云裂之剑，当立则立。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "阿米娅",
    "creator": "xystarworld",
    "creator_uid": 10921,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1638100930",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 40008,
    "uuid": "293e30b8-13df-480e-b40b-3eba96eeafb0",
    "hitokoto": "落峰长日坠，起笔叠嶂升。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "夕",
    "creator": "xystarworld",
    "creator_uid": 10921,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1638100362",
    "length": 12
  },
  {
    "id": 40009,
    "uuid": "9d175e42-48b5-4a01-a929-6bf86f8734f4",
    "hitokoto": "我一直相信，一个人如果对谁都敞开心扉，那么，这个人心里一定不止一扇门。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "空",
    "creator": "飞小RAN",
    "creator_uid": 10481,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1676194819",
    "length": 35
  },
  {
    "id": 40010,
    "uuid": "00663f15-e4ca-4969-b53d-94b22de438b3",
    "hitokoto": "胜败乃兵家常事，既然能进退自如，便不算完败。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "令",
    "creator": "飞小RAN",
    "creator_uid": 10481,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1677430425",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 40011,
    "uuid": "c3c32adf-ec05-410e-8348-126a6e1f3b90",
    "hitokoto": "云峦波涛，千里枯路，江山故人我，晚秋行舟。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "令",
    "creator": "飞小RAN",
    "creator_uid": 10481,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1677430356",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 40012,
    "uuid": "74630a5b-7fb4-48b9-ace2-c73af6113b2a",
    "hitokoto": "长河千嶂，大荒孤城，历历在目。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "令",
    "creator": "飞小RAN",
    "creator_uid": 10481,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1677430375",
    "length": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 40013,
    "uuid": "39cfb450-8907-4304-8da8-60e25974c85f",
    "hitokoto": "如果争端能够避免，那我们应当沉默——如果战斗是必要的，那就战斗到最后！",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "阿米娅",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779636678",
    "length": 35
  },
  {
    "id": 40014,
    "uuid": "0de8497e-283c-40a9-a9c3-c2a7281f153d",
    "hitokoto": "还有很多事情要做，现在还不能休息哦。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "阿米娅",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
