    "length": 18
  },
  {
    "id": 40015,
    "uuid": "df36622c-875c-4b67-80ed-fc55dbf5e2de",
    "hitokoto": "剑能伤人，也能护人。我拔剑，是为了守护那些无力自卫的生命。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "闪灵",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779636678",
    "length": 29
  },
  {
    "id": 40016,
    "uuid": "297f4999-40ab-42f5-bdd3-eca7df188987",
    "hitokoto": "童话故事的结局总是美好的，因为人们需要相信，善良和勇气终会战胜一切不幸。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "爱丽丝",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779636678",
    "length": 36
  },
  {
    "id": 40017,
    "uuid": "e97d2818-9939-4339-8f1a-8efb967ed6b0",
    "hitokoto": "我否定你，把未来寄托给过去，把生命寄托于杀戮。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "阿米娅",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637183",
    "length": 23
  },
  {
    "id": 40018,
    "uuid": "f0d0099d-938a-4d63-826e-832ebce90cc7",
    "hitokoto": "所有精神上的痛苦，都来源于对现实错误的认知。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "明日方舟",
    "from_who": "普瑞赛斯",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
